If you forgot to export your CDLs and framegrabs (as in, the folder is empty), Seagulls will wait for files.  If your thumb drive is not empty, you will be prompted to wipe the drive or to continue as-is.\
\

\f0\b About Seagulls
\f1\b0 \
Seagulls is my first foray into coding in Swift.  It was shamelessly vibe-coded with ChatGPT.\
\
Why \'93Seagulls\'94? Saying \'93CDLs\'94 got old and boring, so we started pronouncing it, like \'93see-dulls.\'94  Which became \'93Seagulls.\'94  Yes, it\'92s dumb.\
\
I laid the groundwork to be able to share this app, but I\'92m certain other users would run into problems.  (Like Seagulls only looks for JPEGs, but maybe you export TIFFs?) If you like the idea of using this app but need me to tweak it for your use case, or if you have bugs or suggestions, please reach out!\
